# Answers: Which environment variables are needed to run?
# Status: 🟢 complete — mirrors what the code actually reads
# Update when: code starts reading a new variable, or stops reading one
#
# The site needs none. Content is files under `content/` (ADR-0018) and there is
# no administration surface (ADR-0019), so there is no database, no auth secret
# and no object store left to configure. `pnpm build` succeeds with no
# environment variables at all.

# Cổng cho server riêng của Playwright (playwright.config.ts). Bỏ trống = 3210.
E2E_PORT=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
